      "sourceText": "**实际云台系是随 yaw 转动的普通机体系，不是世界坐标系。** 云台朝前时，其 `vx>0` 朝车前；云台向左转90°，同样的正 `vx` 方向就转到车左侧。底盘朝向不变，也不妨碍用另一套轴描述它的运动。",
      "translatedText": "**The actual gimbal frame is an ordinary body frame that rotates with yaw, not a world coordinate frame\\.** When the gimbal faces forward, its `vx>0` points toward the front of the vehicle; when the gimbal turns 90° to the left, the same positive `vx` direction rotates to the left side of the vehicle\\. The chassis orientation remains unchanged, and this does not prevent using another set of axes to describe its motion\\.",
